    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/4326e5f80a420d64146097308ad4e0cc.poster.avif?t=1754372310\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/4326e5f80a420d64146097308ad4e0cc.webm?t=1754372310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/4326e5f80a420d64146097308ad4e0cc.mp4?t=1754372310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>&quot;This is a </i>heartwarming b<i>romance Role-Playing game.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After graduating and doing nothing at home, your dad kicks you out to the neighboring town to help your childhood neighbor, Jimmy, prepare a stall for the fireworks festival. In this town, there are handsome people who have appeared in others' stories. This time, you\u2019ll create stories just for them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dateable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/35449b2c4df0cd85b2a63da2afc0c79e.avif?t=1754372310\" data-has-big width=800 height=385 /></span><i>&quot;Every character has their own challenges, but the stories stay warm and uplifting.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leisurely Life and Passionate Romance</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a semi-open, linear game where you\u2019ll spend a few days in the town. During these days, you can relax and enjoy the slow pace of life or dive into a romance story with these NPCs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features six time periods: early morning, morning, afternoon, evening, night, and late night. Moving around the map doesn\u2019t advance time, only certain events will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/0bdccd768e8285c55b44fb403ad8ed58.avif?t=1754372310\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Town</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a side-scrolling map with limited areas to explore. Within this town, there are 5 potential romantic interests. Can you win the heart of your chosen one?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built-in Event Tree</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check the event tree for all the major events in the game, which allows you to know that you missed a major event, but how to get to that event is on your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/35981c9d2e12db3e59ed8e8225448ee2.avif?t=1754372310\" data-has-big width=800 height=374 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/4326e5f80a420d64146097308ad4e0cc.poster.avif?t=1754372310\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/4326e5f80a420d64146097308ad4e0cc.webm?t=1754372310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/4326e5f80a420d64146097308ad4e0cc.mp4?t=1754372310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>&quot;This is a </i>heartwarming b<i>romance Role-Playing game.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After graduating and doing nothing at home, your dad kicks you out to the neighboring town to help your childhood neighbor, Jimmy, prepare a stall for the fireworks festival. In this town, there are handsome people who have appeared in others' stories. This time, you\u2019ll create stories just for them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dateable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/35449b2c4df0cd85b2a63da2afc0c79e.avif?t=1754372310\" data-has-big width=800 height=385 /></span><i>&quot;Every character has their own challenges, but the stories stay warm and uplifting.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leisurely Life and Passionate Romance</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a semi-open, linear game where you\u2019ll spend a few days in the town. During these days, you can relax and enjoy the slow pace of life or dive into a romance story with these NPCs.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features six time periods: early morning, morning, afternoon, evening, night, and late night. Moving around the map doesn\u2019t advance time, only certain events will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/0bdccd768e8285c55b44fb403ad8ed58.avif?t=1754372310\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Town</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a side-scrolling map with limited areas to explore. Within this town, there are 5 potential romantic interests. Can you win the heart of your chosen one?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built-in Event Tree</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can check the event tree for all the major events in the game, which allows you to know that you missed a major event, but how to get to that event is on your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330920/extras/35981c9d2e12db3e59ed8e8225448ee2.avif?t=1754372310\" data-has-big width=800 height=374 /></span></p>",
